#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Kernel Bootloader
#  File: kernel_bootloader.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS kernel bootloader responsible for:
#      • stage‑0 hardware probing
#      • stage‑1 kernel module loading
#      • integrity verification
#      • init‑chain execution
#      • boot telemetry generation
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Module Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Module_Registration)
#    - [Integrity Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Integrity_Verification)
#    - [Boot Sequence](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Boot_Sequence)
#    - [Init Chain](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Init_Chain)
#    - [Boot Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Boot_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_module(name, checksum, entrypoint)
#         Registers a kernel module for boot.
#
#    - verify(name, data)
#         Validates SHA‑256 checksum.
#
#    - load(name, data)
#         Loads module into boot sequence.
#
#    - init_chain()
#         Executes ordered module entrypoints.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full bootloader state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "name": "kernel.health",
#      "checksum": "<sha256>",
#      "entrypoint": "main",
#      "loaded": true/false
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
